    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a natural extension of my curiosity, especially in philosophy where logic and structure intersect. I enjoy solving puzzles and seeing how abstract concepts apply to real life, like in physics or economics. It’s challenging but rewarding, and I find it deeply satisfying when I grasp a new idea.",
