    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools like ChatGPT to check my homework and explain concepts I found tricky. It helped me understand step-by-step solutions without overwhelming me. I didn’t get anxious—it was a great supplement to my learning, especially for topics like calculus.",
